  "nl": "Write me a legal document and contract for a high demand speaker, saying not enough time and our speaker is in very high demand ",
  "trajectory_steps": [
   "assistant: [Your Company Letterhead]\n\n[Date]\n\n[Speaker's Name]\n[Speaker's Address]\n[City, State, Zip]\n\nSubject: Agreement for Speaking Engagement\n\nDear [Speaker's Name],\n\nWe are pleased to extend an offer to you to be a speaker at our esteemed event, [Event Name], scheduled to take place on [Event Date(s)], at [Event Venue/Location]. As a highly sought-after speaker renowned for your expertise and experience, we understand that your time is in high demand. Therefore, we kindly request your consideration of the constraints outlined in this agreement, as we work together to deliver an exceptional event.\n\n1. Event Details:\n   a. Event Name: [Event Name]\n   b. Event Date(s): [Event Date(s)]\n   c. Event Venue: [Event Venue/Location]\n\n2. Speaker's Obligations:\n   a. Speaker shall commit to appearing as the keynote speaker during the event.\n   b. Speaker should deliver [(Duration) minutes/hours] of a compelling, engaging, and informative presentation, focused on the agreed-upon topic.\n   c. Speaker shall allocate [(Duration) minutes/hours] for a question-and-answer session during or after their presentation.\n   d. Speaker shall cooperate with event organizers, providing essential information or materials required for promotional purposes, such as a high-resolution headshot, short bio, and relevant presentation materials.\n\n3. Booking and Fees:\n   a. Speaker agrees to reserve the agreed-upon event date(s) and will not accept any other speaking engagements that may conflict with the event.\n   b. Speaker's fee for this engagement shall be [Amount in Dollars] ([amount in words]) payable within [Number of days] days of signing this agreement. [Payment Method (e.g., bank transfer, check)].\n   c. All relevant expenses associated with the speaking engagement, such as travel, accommodation, and meals, will be covered by [Your Company/Buyer] unless otherwise agreed upon in writing.\n\n4. Cancellation Policy:\n   a. In the event of unavoidable circumstances that prevent the occurrence of the event, both parties will collaborate in good faith to reschedule the speaking engagement to a mutually agreed-upon date.\n   b. In case of cancellation by [Your Company/Buyer] due to reasons beyond the speaker's control, a full reimbursement of all incurred expenses shall be provided to the speaker.\n\n5. Right to Record and Use:\n   a. [Your Company/Buyer] reserves the right to record, stream, or capture photographs during the speaking engagement for promotional, marketing, and archival purposes.\n   b. Speaker hereby grants [Your Company/Buyer] the permission to use their name, likeness, voice, and written or recorded content associated with the event in perpetuity for any purpose related to [Your Company/Buyer]'s activities.\n\n6. Confidentiality and Non-Disclosure:\n   a. Both parties agree to maintain the confidentiality of any information shared or exchanged related to this agreement or the event.\n   b. Speaker shall not disclose, discuss, or make use of any information gained during the event, except for purposes directly related to the event.\n\n7. Governing Law and Jurisdiction:\n   a. This agreement shall be governed by and construed under the laws of [State/Country].\n   b. Any disputes arising out of or relating to this agreement shall be resolved through arbitration in accordance with the rules of the [Arbitration Institution].\n\nPlease review the above terms and conditions carefully. If you agree to the terms outlined herein, please sign and return a copy of this agreement by [Date], indicating your acceptance. If you have any questions or require clarifications, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n\nWe are thrilled to have you as our high-demand speaker and look forward to a successful event. Thank you for considering this offer, and we await your positive response.\n\nWarm regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title/Position]\n[Your Company/Buyer]\n[Your Address]\n[City, State, Zip]\n\nAccepted and Agreed:\n\n[Speaker's Name]\n[Speaker's Signature]\n[Date]",
   "user: No rewrite the above document as I am the speaker looking to send to clients",
   "assistant: [Your Name]\n[Your Address]\n[City, State, Zip]\n[Email Address]\n[Phone Number]\n[Date]\n\n[Client's Name]\n[Client's Address]\n[City, State, Zip]\n\nSubject: Agreement for Speaking Engagement\n\nDear [Client's Name],\n\nI hope this letter finds you in good health and high spirits. I am honored and thrilled by your interest in securing my services as a speaker for your upcoming event, [Event Name], scheduled to be held on [Event Date(s)], at [Event Venue/Location]. As a highly sought-after speaker with numerous commitments, I appreciate your understanding of the time constraints associated with my demanding schedule. In order to ensure the success of the event and proper coordination, I kindly request your consideration of the terms outlined in this agreement.\n\n1. Event Details:\n   a. Event Name: [Event Name]\n   b. Event Date(s): [Event Date(s)]\n   c. Event Venue: [Event Venue/Location]\n\n2. Speaker's Obligations:\n   a. I commit to delivering an engaging, informative, and captivating keynote presentation during the event.\n   b. The presentation duration will be [(Duration) minutes/hours], focusing on the agreed-upon topic.\n   c. I will allocate [(Duration) minutes/hours] for a question-and-answer session, allowing attendees to engage and interact with me during or after my presentation.\n   d. I will cooperate with your team, providing any essential information or materials required for promotional purposes, such as a high-resolution headshot, bio, and relevant presentation materials.\n\n3. Booking and Fees:\n   a. To secure my speaking engagement, a fee of [Amount in Dollars] ([amount in words]) is required. Payment should be made by [Payment Method (e.g., bank transfer, check)] within [Number of days] days of signing this agreement.\n   b. I kindly request that all relevant expenses associated with the speaking engagement, including travel, accommodation, and meals, be covered by your esteemed organization, unless otherwise agreed upon in writing.\n\n4. Cancellation Policy:\n   a. In the event that circumstances outside of your control require the event to be canceled, I am willing to work with you to reschedule the speaking engagement for a later date, subject to our mutual availability.\n   b. If you must cancel the event due to reasons beyond my control, I kindly request reimbursement for any already incurred expenses.\n\n5. Right to Record and Use:\n   a. With your permission, I may record, stream, or capture photographs during my presentation for promotional, marketing, and archival purposes.\n   b. I kindly request your consent to use my name, likeness, voice, and any associated content from the event for promotional purposes related to my activities.\n\n6. Confidentiality and Non-Disclosure:\n   a. We agree to maintain the confidentiality of any proprietary or sensitive information exchanged between us regarding this agreement or the event.\n   b. I assure you that I will not disclose, discuss, or make use of any information gained during the event, except as necessary for the success of the engagement.\n\n7. Governing Law and Jurisdiction:\n   a. This agreement shall be governed by and construed under the laws of [State/Country].\n   b. Any disputes arising out of or relating to this agreement shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in [State/Country].\n\nPlease carefully review the terms and conditions outlined above. If you agree to proceed with this agreement, kindly indicate your acceptance by signing and returning a copy of this document no later than [Date]. If you require any clarification or have additional questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nThank you for considering my services as a high-demand speaker for your event. I am eager to collaborate with you and contribute to the success of your program. I look forward to our partnership and a remarkable event.\n\nWarm regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title/Position]\n[Your Website/Bio Link]",
