   "model (models/chat-bison-001, score=83): Here are some of the best pickup lines:\n\n1. Are you a campfire? Because you're hot and I want s'more.\n2. Is there an airport nearby or is that just my heart taking off?\n3. I'm not a photographer, but I can picture us together.\n4. Is there an ATM in your jeans? Because I'd like to withdraw some interest.\n5. Is your name Wi-Fi? Because I'm feeling a connection.\n6. Is your name Google? Because you have everything I've been searching for.\n7. Are you a campfire? Because you're hot and I want s'more.\n8. Do you have a map? I'm getting lost in your eyes.\n9. Are you a parking ticket? Because you've got fine written all over you.\n10. Are you a banana? Because I find you a-peeling.\n\nIt is important to remember that not all pickup lines are created equal. Some are more effective than others, and some may even be considered offensive. The best way to use a pickup line is to be confident and genuine, and to let your personality shine through.",
   "user (None, score=None): give me ones that are more realistic and would work in real life",
   "model (models/chat-bison-001, score=29): Here are some realistic and more likely to work in real life pickup lines:\n\n* Hi, I'm [your name]. What's yours?\n* I'm new in town, do you know any good places to eat?\n* I'm having a great time here, would you like to dance?\n* I'm not usually this forward, but I couldn't help but notice you. Would you like to get together sometime?\n* I'm not sure if you're interested, but I think you're really cute. Would you like to exchange numbers?\n* I'm having a great time talking to you, would you like to get out of here and continue this conversation somewhere else?\n\nIt's important to be confident and genuine when using a pickup line. Make eye contact, smile, and introduce yourself. If the person seems interested, start a conversation and ask them questions about themselves. Be respectful and listen to what they have to say. And most importantly, be yourself and have fun!",
   "model (models/chat-bison-001, score=92): Sure, here are some pickup lines that are more realistic and would work in real life:\n\n* \"Hi, I'm [your name]. I'd love to get to know you better.\"\n* \"I've been admiring you from across the room. I couldn't help but come over and say hello.\"\n* \"You look like you're fun to be around. What are you up to tonight?\"\n* \"I'm not usually this bold, but I had to come over and introduce myself. I'm [your name].\"\n* \"I'm new in town and don't know anyone. Would you like to show me around?\"\n\nIt's important to remember that the best way to approach someone is to be confident and genuine. Don't try to be someone you're not, and don't use cheesy pickup lines. Just be yourself and let your personality shine through.",
